B.vi=new A.a5(B.OM,["No element","{e}","Crit","{name}: {text}","Dodge by a hair. Strike like lightning.","Best ","   Reached {area}","\xa9 RAISEN","A hundred years ago,\nDragon King Bahamut was sealed away\nat the cost of a hero\u2019s life.","And tonight\u2014\nthe seal broke.","The royal knights fell in one night.\nOnly one swordsman is left\nin the castle town.","...You. Just an apprentice,\nwith a rusty sword and cloth armor.","But this town has a blacksmith\nwhose skill is the stuff of legend.","Ganz: \u201cBring me materials.\nI\u2019ll forge you the strongest blade.\n...Probably.\u201d","Now go.\nNo one else is left\nto slay the Dragon King.","\u2014 TAP: SET OUT \u2014","Every quest complete!","Castle Town","Home of Ganz the Blacksmith","The north gate is open!","Peace returns...?","{boss} defeated","Goblin Territory","Where the Wolves Roam","Where the Stone Giant Sleeps","Lair of the Fire Dragon","The Frozen Summit","Throne of the Dragon King","TAP: Talk to Ganz the Blacksmith","TAP: Talk to Rosa the Jeweler","TAP: Back to village","TAP: Travel Gate","Not yet!","First: \u201c{quest}\u201d","Learn the Moves","\u2014 TAP TO CLOSE \u2014","Watch closely...","Goal: {recipe}","Got it all! To the smith!","Tyrant of the Grassland","The Thunder-Clad Wolf","Guardian of the Ages","Lord of the Inferno","King of the Frozen Sky","The Dragon King of the End","A Mighty Foe","Defeated...","No materials lost.","Materials lost (half)","+{n} more","Gear up and try again.","Back to Village","Dragon King Slain!","Ganz the Blacksmith","\u201c...Got any materials left?\n  I\u2019ll show you what lies beyond \u26055.\u201d","\u2014 And the adventure goes on \u2014","\u2460 SWIPE","\u2461 TAP \xd73","NOW!","SWIPE TO DODGE!","JUST DODGE!","TAP: RAISEN!","RAISEN!","{n} more {n|tap|taps}","High","Mid","Low","Menu","Gear","Skills","How to Play","SFX {level}","Close","Reset Save Data","Erase your save and start over.\nAll gear, materials and quest\nprogress will be lost.\nThis can\u2019t be undone.","Cancel","Erase and Start Over","Sortie","Where to?"," (boss alive)","Mine","Hunt","Part","Chest","Have {n}","Have {n} / Need {need}","  Got it!","  {n} to go","Where to find it"," (not reached)","This material\u2019s [Traits]","[{name}]","Effect","Materials with this [Trait]","Craft with 3 materials that share it\nand the gear is sure to get it.\nFuse in same-skill gear to grow it.","Have {n}","Skill Book","Material [Traits] become skills on the gear you craft.\nTap a name to see which materials carry it.","Have mats","Inventory","Materials","None","No gear for this slot yet.\nHave the smith make some.","Status","Skills","Tap a name for info","None (match material [Traits] to get one)","ATK {atk}","DEF {def} HP {hp}","ATK {atk} HP {hp}","{slot} \xb7 {line}","Equip","Salvage returns:","Salvaging returns no materials","Salvage","Equipped","No materials yet.\nGo hunt some monsters.","Total material value {n}","Value {n}","Rosa","Ganz","...Beat the boss, eh? Not bad.\nTime I taught you to fuse.","...Beat the boss, eh? Not bad.\nTime to fuse. No spare sword?\nTake this one. On the house.","...I\u2019m Ganz, the smith.\nGot materials? I\u2019ll add what\u2019s\nmissing. Go craft an Iron Sword.","What\u2019ll it be?","Materials don\u2019t lie.\nLuck? Not my problem.","The forge is hot.","Ready to take a gamble?","Welcome! I\u2019m Rosa, the jeweler.\nI\u2019ll make you something lovely.\nThe first materials are on me!","Hehe, you came back!","What shall we make today?","Bring me something pretty?","I\u2019ll find what suits you.","Start with the Thunder Ring.\nThe materials are all ready.\nGo on, press \u201cCraft\u201d!","First, make some gear.\nPress \u201cCraft Gear\u201d up top.","Got the materials? Hit \u201cCraft\u201d.\nStronger gear, lower odds.\nI\u2019m watching this time. No fails.","Fusing makes gear stronger.\nPress \u201cFuse Gear\u201d up top.","Pick the sword to power up.\nUsually the one you\u2019re holding.","Next, \u201cPick\u201d a sword to feed it.\nThe fed sword is gone, and its\npower goes into the base.","Press \u201cFuse!\u201d.\nThe more you stack, the flashier.\nNormally it\u2019s down to the odds.","Last thing: the \u201cGoal\u201d.\nPress \u201cCraft Gear\u201d up top.","Aim for this one next.\nPress \u201cGoal\u201d and what\u2019s missing\nshows at right. Hunt for it.","Oh... it cracked.\nI\u2019m so sorry.","The materials got moody.\nTry again?","...Burned to ash.\nThe forge has bad days too.","Strong gear makes a picky forge.\nGo get more materials.","...Sorry. Again.","Hehe, I outdid myself!","That\u2019s about it for today.\nCome again!","What shall I make next?","...A masterpiece.","...That\u2019s all I\u2019ve got today.\nCome back and forge again.","What\u2019s next?","Success rate {pct}%","Goal removed.","Good. That\u2019s your \u201cGoal\u201d.\nWhat\u2019s missing shows at right.\nNow hunt, gather, forge.","\u201c{recipe}\u201d is the goal.\nWhat you lack shows in the field.","That\u2019s fusing. Stack it up.\nThe higher it goes, the riskier.\nThe rest is up to you.","Whoa... Fuse Lv {n}?","Good. It took.","...Rejected. The fed gear\u2019s gone.","The forge said no. ...Next.","Got greedy, huh?","Jeweler","Blacksmith","Craft Gear","Fuse Gear","Too early for fusing.\nBeat the {area} boss first.","Fuse (locked)","{who} (Guide)","Recipes ","??? \xd7{n}  (unlocks at {area})","???  (unlocks at {area})","Craft","ATK {atk}","DEF {def}  HP {hp}","ATK {atk}  HP {hp}","  {e}","[{name}\u2605{n}]","Pinned","Goal","\u2460 Pick the gear to power up","\u2460 Gear to power up","Change","No {slot} to feed it.\nGo make some with \u201cCraft Gear\u201d.","\u2461 Pick gear to feed it (it gets used up)","Remove","Pick","Equipped ","  Fuse Lv{n}","No skills","Fusion forecast","Pick gear to feed it.","Fuse Lv {from} \u2192 {to}","Success","\u25c6Grows: ","\u25c7May carry over: ","Skill slots full: no new skills fit","If it fails, the fed gear is lost","Fuse!","Fusing...","TAP: SKIP","Rejected...","Failed...","The base gear is safe","The fed gear is gone","Failed... the materials are ash","...Next","...Oh dear, it cracked.","Sorry, the materials are in a mood today.","Hehe, next time for sure.","...Rejected. It didn\u2019t take.","...Failed.","You trusted me with junk like that?","The materials were better off raw.","...The forge balked. Bad luck.","All ash now.","[{name}] grew","[{name}] carried over","GREAT SUCCESS!!","FUSED!","ATK {from} \u2192 {to}","DEF {from} \u2192 {to}","Nice","SUCCESS","SUCCESS!","Masterwork! Better than usual","Crit +{pct}%","Speed +{pct}%","Made {n} (tap one for details)","Rosa  ","Ganz  ","...Hehe, my finest work.","Oh, gorgeous. It suits you.","Here you go, all done.","What the... Never seen this before.","...My finest work.","...Not bad. No\u2014good.","...Done.","Keep","Red: down in 2 hits. Danger!","Orange: within 4 hits. Stay sharp.","Yellow: within 8 hits. Fair fight.","Green: you won\u2019t lose.","Your Goal","The ancient seal broke. Monsters roam.","Grassland, Forest, Cave, Volcano, Snowpeak, Demon Castle.","Beat the boss deep in each area to open the north gate.","Last of all: Dragon King Bahamut.","Controls \u2460 Move & Attack","Drag: walk toward your finger.","Tap: slash. Keep tapping for a 3-hit combo.","The 3rd hit is a leaping overhead smash.","Controls \u2461 Dodge","Swipe: roll the way you flick.","You\u2019re invincible while rolling.","Enemy attacks come after a red warning. Watch for it.","Secret Art: JUST Dodge & Raisen","Dodge as the red warning hits: JUST!","While awakened, every hit is a Crit.","Tap fast for Raisen: dash through foes","Up to 3 lightning strikes (4\xd7 power).","Reading Enemy Strength","The color of the name overhead shows the danger to you.","Elites and bosses are tough, but drop good materials.","Gathering Materials","Slay monsters, mine rocks, open chests.","Walk over dropped loot to pick it up.","If you fall, you lose half the materials from that trip.","In trouble? Return circle to the village.","HP recovers quickly in the village.","Return circle: near each area\u2019s entrance (and deep inside once its boss is down).","North gate: head out to any area you\u2019ve reached.","Ganz the Blacksmith: crafts and fuses gear.","Crafting Gear","Pick one of Ganz\u2019s recipes and pay materials to craft it.","The stronger the gear, the lower the success rate.","Fail, and the materials turn to ash.","More \u2605 means better work. Sometimes a masterpiece.","Goals & Where to Find","Press \u201cGoal\u201d on a recipe and the missing","materials show at right. Hunt for them.","Tap a material to see where to slay,","mine or loot it.","Fusing & Skills","Feed gear into other gear to make the base stronger.","Feed gear with the same skill to grow that skill.","The higher the Fuse Lv, the brighter the gear shines.","Check skill effects under Gear and Skills.","\u2190 Back","Next \u2192","Close","Controls \u2460 Attack","Tap to slash\nTap fast for a 3-hit combo;\nthe 3rd is a leaping strike","Secret Art: JUST Dodge","Swipe on the \u201cNOW!\u201d signal\nThen tap \xd73 for Raisen\nTime stops while you practice","Hunting","Foes drop materials\nWalk up to them to pick up","Tap by a glowing rock\nOre pops out","Return","Step on the circle by the\nentrance to go home.\nHP heals fast in the village","Swipe \u2192 roll that way\nDodge the red warnings","Give it a try!","To village! HP heals","RAISEN: Lightning Hero: reporting an ad","What was the ad (what it showed, and where it appeared)?","Materials recovered","Your materials are safe. Go again.","Loading ad\u2026","Watch an Ad to Recover","Watch an Ad to Craft It","Watch an Ad to Fuse It","Couldn\u2019t load an ad","Privacy Policy","Report an Ad","Privacy Settings","Licenses","RAISEN: Lightning Hero","Privacy","Settings","Back","None","Fire","Ice","Thunder","Dark","Holy","Mineral","Beast","Magic","Undead","Dragon","Giant","Gold","Weapon","Armor","Accessory","Sword","Greatsword","Dagger","Spear","Staff","Core","Blade","Guard","Body","Trim","Base","Gem","Slime Jelly","Iron Ore","Goblin Fang","Beast Hide","Ogre Horn","Gold Nugget","King's Crown","Silver Ore","Dire Fang","Bee Stinger","Volt Crystal","Bear Claw","Mutant Horn","Fenrir Fang","Bat Wing","Old Bone","Magestone","Mithril","Soul Gem","Golem Core","Obsidian","Fire Crystal","Salamander Tail","Dragon Scale","Volka Scale","Volka Wing","Volka Tail","Frost Ore","Snow Fang","Ice Crystal","Yeti Fur","Glacie Fang","Glacie Wing","Glacie Tail","Holy Silver","Dark Orb","Knight Crest","Angel Feather","Bahamut Horn","Bahamut Heart","Slime","Goblin","Goblin Archer","Ogre","Golden Goblin","Goblin King","Dire Wolf","Thunder Bee","Great Bear","Mutant Ogre","Fenrir","Skeleton","Shadow Bat","Stone Golem","Gold Skeleton","Giant Golem","Salamander","Fire Wisp","Lava Golem","Gold Salamander","Volka the Fire Dragon","Snow Wolf","Ice Wisp","Yeti","Golden Wolf","Glacie the Ice Dragon","Dark Knight","Dark Mage","Death Knight","Gold Knight","Dragon King Bahamut","Core","Head","Left Wing","Right Wing","Tail","Body","Grassland","Forest","Cave","Volcano","Snowpeak","Demon Castle","Might","Vigor","Bulwark","Keen","Deadly","Gale","Blaze","Frost","Storm","Shadow","Divine","Burst","Berserk","Devour","Riposte","Counter","Bolt","Chain","Leech","Reckless","Scorch","Freeze","Slayer","Greed","Triple","Frenzy","Twin","Thorns","Breaker","Reaper","Regen","Acrobat","ATK +{v}%","Max HP +{v}%","DEF +{v}%","Crit rate +{v}%","Crit damage +{v}%","Attack speed +{v}%","Fire damage +{v}%","Ice damage +{v}%","Thunder damage +{v}%","Dark damage +{v}%","Holy damage +{v}%","Crits explode ({v}%)","ATK +{v}% under 30% HP","Heal {v}% HP per kill","After a dodge, next hit crits","ATK +{v}% for 3s after a dodge","{v}% chance of a bolt on hit","Bolts chain to {v} more","Drain {v}% of damage dealt","Max HP -30%, ATK +{v}%","Hits burn ({v}%/s)","Hits slow foes by {v}%","Boss damage +{v}%","Material drops +{v}%","3rd-hit damage +{v}%","Faster on hit streaks (max +{v}%)","{v}% chance to hit twice","When hit, strike back for {v}% ATK","Part damage +{v}%","Always crit foes under 25% HP","Heal {v}% HP per second","Dodge range & invuln +{v}%","Raises ATK, plain and simple. When in doubt, take this.","More max HP. You can take more hits.","Raises DEF, so you take less damage.","Crits (critical hits) come more often. Pairs well with [Deadly].","Crits hit harder. Add more crits with [Keen] and it takes off.","Less time between attacks: more hits.","Fire attacks hit harder. Works only with a Fire weapon. Good on ice foes.","Ice attacks hit harder. Works only with an Ice weapon. Good on fire foes.","Thunder attacks hit harder. Works only with a Thunder weapon. Good on golems.","Dark attacks hit harder. Works only with a Dark weapon.","Holy attacks hit harder. Works only with a Holy weapon. Good on undead and dark foes.","Crits explode, catching nearby foes too.","Below 30% HP, ATK shoots up. For living on the edge.","Heal with every kill. Keeps you going where small fry swarm.","Your first hit after a dodge always crits.","A dodge raises ATK for 3 seconds.","Hits may call down lightning for extra damage. With [Chain] it jumps to others.","[Bolt] lightning jumps from foe to foe. Take it with [Bolt].","Drain part of the damage you deal as HP.","Max HP drops by 30%, but ATK goes way up.","Sets foes on fire to wear them down.","Slows the foes you hit. For fast ones.","More damage to bosses. Your ace for boss fights.","Foes drop more materials. For farming.","Your 3rd hit (the end of the combo) hits harder.","The longer you keep hitting, the faster you swing.","A hit may land twice.","When hit, you deal damage back.","More damage to parts like dragon wings and tails. Broken parts drop special materials.","Always crit foes at 25% HP or less. For the finishing blow.","Heal a little HP every second.","Longer dodge rolls and longer invulnerability.","Dracolich","Dracolich Blade","Raiju","Raiju Blade","Titan","Titan Blade","Sage","Sage's Stone","Annihilation","Voidblade","Holy Dragon","Holy Dragon Mail","Chaos","Chaos Ring","Ultra {name}","Rusty Sword","Cloth Tunic","Iron Sword","Goblin Blade","Ogre Blade","King's Sword","Leather Armor","Ogre Mail","Steel Sword","Direfang Sword","Stinger Sword","Bear Cleaver","Fenrir Edge","Wolfhide Armor","Bearskin Mail","Thunder Ring","Mithril Sword","Bone Sword","Magestone Sword","Golem Breaker","Mithril Mail","Bat Cloak","Soul Amulet","Flame Sword","Salamander Fang","Obsidian Claymore","Volka Blade","Dragonscale Mail","Volka Mail","Ember Amulet","Ice Sword","Snowfang Sword","Yeti Crusher","Glacie Blade","Yeti Coat","Glacie Mail","Frost Ring","Holy Silver Sword","Dark Knight Sword","Angel Sword","Bahamut Blade","Paladin Mail","Dark Orb Necklace","ATK","DEF","Max HP","Crit Rate","Crit Dmg","Atk Speed","Element","{e} Dmg","w/ {e} weapon","Boss Dmg","Part Dmg","3rd Hit Dmg","Drops","Drain","{v} of dmg","max {v}/hit","HP Regen","{v}/s","Kill Heal","Dodge","Invuln +{v}","Range +{v}","Hits burn for {v} dmg/s","Crits explode for ~{v} dmg"," ({v} dmg)"," (ATK {v})"," ({v}/s)"," (needs [{s}])","{area}: {what}"," (sometimes)"," (rarely)","Defeat {who}{often}","Defeat {tag} {who}{often}","Wings","Cut off {tag} {who}'s {part}","Break {tag} {who}'s {part}","Open chests","Elite","Rare","Boss","Village","Secret path!","{part} broken","DOWN!","Grounded!","SLAIN!","Treasure!","Awakened \u2014 every hit crits","Core exposed!"," DANGER!","Head to the Grassland","Drag to walk. Leave by the north gate of the square","Tap to attack","Keep tapping for a 3-hit combo. The 3rd is a leap slash","Swipe to dodge","Roll where you flick. You can't be hit mid-roll","JUST Dodge \u2192 Raisen",'Swipe on "NOW!", then tap \xd73',"Defeat 3 monsters","Walk over materials to grab them. Recipes make them gear","Dig at a mining spot","Tap by a glowing rock to dig up ore","Return to the village","Step on the return circle by the entrance. HP refills in the village","Visit Ganz the Blacksmith","The man with the ! right of the square","Craft an Iron Sword","Craft it from Ganz's recipes","Set your next gear as a Goal",'Tap "Goal" on a recipe to track the materials it needs',"Defeat Elite {m}","Can't win? Check the recipes and gather materials","Defeat Boss {m}","In the arena at the far north of the {area}","Fuse a sword","At Ganz's, feed one sword to another to make it stronger","Push on to the {area}","Past the north gate of the last area","Deep in the {area}","Visit Rosa the Jeweler","The woman with the ! left of the square","Craft an accessory","Craft it from Rosa's recipes","Forge \u26055 gear","Throw a pile of rare materials into the forge","All quests done!","Hunt. Gather. Gamble. Grow strong."],t.li)
